<info>
  <ul>
    <li>Starter component - edit anything on the right, the demo on the left recompiles as you type.</li>
    <li>Typed props via <code>PROPS</code>, a prop seeded into <code>this.state</code>, an auto-cleaned <code>this.setInterval</code>, scoped <code>&lt;style&gt;</code>.</li>
